{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over a crumbling, haunted caf\u00e9 and transform it into a sanctuary for monstrous guests. Restore, decorate, and expand while brewing strange coffees, stocking supplies, and keeping hostile anomalies at bay. My Little Cafe Nightmare is a dark yet cozy first-person caf\u00e9 sim where every cup matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/59c3dc0426d9f84c0e962dbb5374cdac.poster.avif?t=1774338971\" width=1080 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/59c3dc0426d9f84c0e962dbb5374cdac.webm?t=1774338971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/59c3dc0426d9f84c0e962dbb5374cdac.mp4?t=1774338971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RENOVATE &amp; CUSTOMIZE YOUR CAFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe new life into a forgotten caf\u00e9. Repair the rot, decorate with care, and expand your space to create a warm refuge for wandering creatures of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/94c8d586e95bc68c4368d216ab8452dc.poster.avif?t=1774338971\" width=1080 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/94c8d586e95bc68c4368d216ab8452dc.webm?t=1774338971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/94c8d586e95bc68c4368d216ab8452dc.mp4?t=1774338971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREW OTHERWORLDLY COFFEE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft hauntingly good drinks with unique flavours to satisfy the peculiar cravings of your ghostly visitors. Each guest has their own taste, and only the right brew will earn their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/72319dd036c8b6cc8d4dcb168494872b.poster.avif?t=1774338971\" width=1080 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/72319dd036c8b6cc8d4dcb168494872b.webm?t=1774338971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/72319dd036c8b6cc8d4dcb168494872b.mp4?t=1774338971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR LOGISTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage ingredients, cups, and equipment carefully. Order supplies, keep your storage tidy, and make sure your caf\u00e9 can withstand the endless demand of spectral customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/43ff519d882cdd7360fcb1d554532abd.poster.avif?t=1774338971\" width=1080 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/43ff519d882cdd7360fcb1d554532abd.webm?t=1774338971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/43ff519d882cdd7360fcb1d554532abd.mp4?t=1774338971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726250?t=1774338971","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/489c9df